<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Extraction Regular Expressions for Math responses</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For the responses to Math prompts, we first utilize the following code to extract the final numerical value as the answer for judging the consistency of any two responses.</p>
<div id="A1.p1.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_Python ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">def</span><span id="lstnumberx1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">extract_last_num</span><span id="lstnumberx1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">(</span><span id="lstnumberx1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">text</span><span id="lstnumberx1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">:</span><span id="lstnumberx1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_lst_keywords2 ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">str</span><span id="lstnumberx1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">)</span><span id="lstnumberx1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">-&gt;</span><span id="lstnumberx1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_lst_keywords2 ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">float</span><span id="lstnumberx1.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">:</span>
</div>
