<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Codes for Normalizing Code Snippets</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
